<title>UK: Unilever yr pretax profit up 15 pct.</title>
<headline>Unilever yr pretax profit up 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		85.90		  up 78.63</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 21.76		  vs 22.35</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 32.05		  vs 29.40</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    2,657		  vs 2,319</p>
<p> Turnover		   33,522		 vs 31,516</p>
<p>				    - Three months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		22.42		  vs 14.65</p>
<p> Pretax		     741		    vs 413</p>
<p> Turnover		   8,673		  vs 8,083</p>
